{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build on rooftops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543130/extras/shop0_medium_1_.gif?t=1743230903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Construct buildings on <strong>rooftops</strong> to save space and gain strategic advantages, like shooting over walls to defend against threats,\u00a0making it easier to take down zombies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless zombie hordes push you to the limit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543130/extras/shop02.gif?t=1743230903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The zombie horde never stops. They are too many. <strong>Research, develop advanced technology, and train survivors</strong> to combat the ever-growing and evolving undead threat. Adapt or be overrun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow, manage, and protect your settlement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543130/extras/shop03_small_compact.gif?t=1743230903\" />Create a secure haven where survivors can <strong>eat, sleep, and recover</strong>. Establish a steady supply of food and resources, and build an efficient crafting chain to support your frontline fighters. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543130?t=1743230903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543130?t=1743230903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543130/66a880af0044002d86c8110c1a6ffe23ea8fef74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743230903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543130/66a880af0044002d86c8110c1a6ffe23ea8fef74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743230903","categories":[{"de